"ltr\"><h4>Greetings and congratulations to all dear Iranians on the ancient Nowruz holiday</h4>\n<h2>Here we want to talk a bit about research and inventions</h2>\n<h4>New research and inventions are conducted in various fields and areas of science and industry. Some new research and inventions can be in the fields of medicine, information technology, robotics, environmental sciences, physics, chemistry, engineering, biology, and so on.</h4>\n<h4>For example, in the field of medicine, research is being conducted in genetics, cancer treatment, chronic diseases, and new vaccines and pharmaceutical products. In the field of <a href=\"https://mehrdad.ir/%d8%a7%db%8c%d9%86%d8%aa%d8%b1%d9%86%d8%aa-%d8%a7%d8%b4%db%8c%d8%a7-iot-internet-of-things-%da%86%db%8c%d8%b3%d8%aa-%d8%9f/\" rel=\"noopener\">information technology,</a> research is being conducted in the fields of <a href=\"https://mehrdad.ir/%d9%be%d8%b1%d9%88%da%98%d9%87-%d8%b7%d8%b1%d8%a7%d8%ad%db%8c-%d8%b4%d9%87%d8%b1-%d9%87%d9%88%d8%b4%d9%85%d9%86%d8%af/\" rel=\"noopener\">artificial intelligence</a>, neural networks, deep and long-term learning, websites, cryptocurrencies, blockchain, cybersecurity, and other related topics.</h4>\n<h4>As examples of new inventions, one can mention electric vehicles, unmanned aircraft, collaborative robots, advanced medical devices, smart electronic products, measuring devices, and advanced communication networks.</h4>\n<h4>New research and inventions are very important for improving our quality of life and developing the global economy, and they can help solve complex problems and the challenges of today's world.</h4>\nsrc=\"/media/output_1.png\"Research in robotics in America Mehrdad website<br />\nmehrdad\n<h2> Research in Robotics in America</h2>\n<h4>The field of robotics in the United States is one of the most active and applied fields in technology. Recently, much new research has been conducted in this area. Some of the latest research in robotics in the United States includes:</h4>\n<h4>1- Building new and intelligent robots using artificial intelligence and deep learning technology.</h4>\n<h4>2- Research in medical robots for performing precise and advanced operations.</h4>\n<h4>3- Research in collaborative robots for use in automotive, construction, aerospace, and other industries.</h4>\n<h4>4- Research in military and security robots for preventing terrorist attacks, border control, and other purposes.</h4>\n<h4>5- Research in domestic and service robots to help the elderly, disabled, and people who need assistance.</h4>\n<h4>6- Research in flying robots and drones for use in areas such as aerial photography, environment, search and rescue, and more.</h4>\n<h4>This research and studies are very important for technological development and improving human quality of life and will likely have applications in various industries and fields in the near future.</h4>\n<h3>In the field of robotics, many companies operate in the United States, but some important companies in this field include:</h3>\n<h4>1- Boston Dynamics: This company is engaged in building advanced and mobile robots using artificial intelligence and deep learning technology. The company's robots, including Spot and Atlas, have attracted a lot of attention.</h4>\n<h4>2- iRobot: This company is engaged in building domestic and service robots such as vacuuming robots and search and rescue robots.</h4>\n<h4>3- Kinectrics: This company is engaged in developing industrial robots as well as service and medical robots.</h4>\n<h4>4- Intuitive Surgical: This company is engaged in building medical robots for performing precise and advanced operations such as the Da Vinci robot.</h4>\n<h4>5- Amazon: This company is engaged in developing collaborative robots and goods delivery using personal and non-personal robots such as warehouse robots.</h4>\n<h4>6- IBM: This company is engaged in developing smart robots such as Watson, which through the use of artificial intelligence and deep learning, have the ability to answer complex questions and various big data.</h4>\n<h4>These companies are known as some of the pioneers in development and advancement in the field of robotics in the United States.</h4>\n<h4></h4>\n<h4>The revenue of these companies from their robotic activities varies greatly and can vary depending on the size and nature of the companies' activities. For example, Boston Dynamics was purchased by Alphabet for $300 million in 2020. But for another example, iRobot had revenue of about $1.26 billion in 2020. Therefore, the revenue of these companies varies greatly and attention should be paid to specific companies.</h4>\n<h2>A lot of research and studies are underway in the field of transportation that will ensure improved transportation methods in the future. Some new inventions and research in the field of transportation include:</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<h3>Driverless vehicles: Various companies such as Waymo, Tesla, and Cruise have developed driverless cars that use artificial intelligence, sensors, and autonomous systems.</h3>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h3>New battery technologies: Companies such as Tesla and Rivian are developing batteries with faster charging capabilities, greater range, and longer durability.</h3>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h3>Smart vehicle transportation networks: Companies such as Uber and Lyft are developing smart vehicle transportation networks that allow users to have safer and more optimized routing and driving through artificial intelligence and advanced algorithms.</h3>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h3>New vehicle technologies: Companies such as Ford and General Motors are developing new technologies that include internet connectivity, smart sensors, and LED strips.</h3>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>This research and studies also include smart technologies, clean energy, and smart traffic systems, which aim to improve urban and rural transportation.</h3>\n<h4>Given the technological developments and their impact on our lives, it is very important to follow news and new articles in fields such as artificial intelligence, robotics, smart transportation, and technology. Mehrdad website, based on research and world advancements, helps you make the best decisions by keeping you updated with the latest news and articles in these fields. By following Mehrdad website, you will always be in pursuit of learning and self-improvement. I also recommend that you introduce this website to your friends and colleagues so that everyone can benefit from these articles.</h4></div><aside aria-label=\"Ready to turn this into a product?\" class=\"mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-violet-500/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-violet-600/10 to-fuchsia-600/10 p-5 sm:p-6\"><h2 class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold leading-snug\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-rocket h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-violet-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91a2.18 2.18 0 0 0-2.91-.09z\"></path><path d=\"m12 15-3-3a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.95A12.88 12.88 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.35 22.35 0 0 1-4 2z\"></path><path d=\"M9 12H4s.55-3.03 2-4c1.62-1.08 5 0 5 0\"></path><path d=\"M12 15v5s3.03-.55 4-2c1.08-1.62 0-5 0-5\"></path></svg>Ready to turn this into a product?</h2><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">In one AI MVP Sprint I take your idea from first sketch to a live product — in weeks, not months.</p><div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-2.5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-violet-600 to-fuchsia-600 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:from-violet-700 hover:to-fuchsia-700\" href=\"/mvp-sprint\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 2